# ToolkitUI - Test Cases

## TDD Mandate
These tests MUST be written in XCTest BEFORE implementing the feature.

1. **Test `ThemeManager` throws an assertion when accessed off the Main Thread**.
2. **Test `View.redacted(if: true)` properly maps to the Skeleton modifier overlay**.
3. **Test `CoachMark` calculates correct screen coordinates given an anchored view proxy**.
